### What the run that makes a node's name says, whichever command made it.

named-home = { $home }
    .keyword = home

named-keep = that directory. lose it and you lose this name, every hour
    anyone ever witnessed for you, and any way of proving you
    were here. There is no recovery and there is no appeal.
    To move it to another machine: `333 pack <FILE>` here, then
    `333 unpack <FILE>` there.
    .keyword = keep
